    "description": "In Amochiroom Puzzle: Room Sort, turn everyday clutter into a satisfying sorting puzzle.\n\nExplore cozy rooms, find the items your boxes need, and tap matching objects to pack them away. Read each box label and choose what to collect next. Items without a matching box wait in limited temporary slots, so a little planning helps you keep making space.\n\nFind it. Sort it.\nLook through piles of familiar objects and match them to the right boxes. Decide which items to collect first as you work through each room.\n\nA place for your next move\nKeep an eye on your temporary slots. Make thoughtful choices before they fill up, and clear space for the next objects.\n\nRooms with their own character\nDiscover living rooms, kitchens, pet corners, cafés, and other themed spaces filled with everyday things to sort.\n\nEnjoy the tidy finish\nComplete puzzles, earn stars, and revisit earlier rooms to improve your best times.\n\nPlay your way\nChoose from multiple interface languages and adjust music, sound effects, and vibration. Your progress is saved on your device, and no account registration is required.\n\nAmochiroom Puzzle is free to play and contains ads. Optional rewarded ads can provide extra space, helpful tools, or energy; interstitial ads may appear between levels. Ads and optional feedback require an internet connection.",
